sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as Frontend (trip-planner-web)
  participant API as Backend API (trip-planner)
  participant DB as Database
  participant EXT as External APIs

  User->>UI: Enter trip preferences
  UI->>API: POST /api/plans (preferences)
  API->>API: Validate session/JWT
  API->>EXT: Fetch places/weather/AI (optional)
  EXT-->>API: Results / suggestions
  API->>DB: Save generated plan
  DB-->>API: Plan ID
  API-->>UI: 200 OK (plan JSON)
  UI-->>User: Render itinerary
